        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年7月18日</color>\n纳塔常年炎热，只要你愿意，每天都可以算作盛夏的假期 所以不妨先放下冒险委托、派蒙的伙食、古龙文明遗事、挪德卡莱的访客以及大团长的来信 尽情享受免费食宿和游玩项目吧！\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=_-E6ai_LZxQ"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《原神》阿夏的悠悠时光"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/08/05/237301566/ddbb5070131d241397ac0379235f44b2_5292863874730512948.png",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffd780>2025年7月21日</color>\n与悠悠度假村的吉祥物——阿夏，一起舞动起来吧！\n<color=#ff9999>YouTube:</color>"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomVideo",
        "url": "https:/www.youtube.com/watch?v=nF4xaHv0XoI"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 1,
        "text": "教学",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "《悠悠度假村攻略》"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
