        "name": "涂鸦",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/03/326985891/1ef525b101a31611b9fe2cc1b0a59aa8_1083127708934099735.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 14
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8370,
        "name": "醅幽花",
        "desc": "醅幽花的花粉是制造蜜酿的特殊材料，而醅幽花本身亦是具有灵性的特殊植物…如果有人贸然接近，它就会毫不留情地合上自己的花瓣。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/26/1ef525b101a31611b9fe2cc1b0a59aa8_5399817270232465212.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 14
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8371,
        "name": "异常的醅幽花",
        "desc": "似乎有奇怪的东西混入醅幽花的花丛中，这些醅幽花<color=#FFE14BFF>有人靠近却仍然张开着花瓣</color>…<br>去调查看看到底发生了什么吧…",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/26/1ef525b101a31611b9fe2cc1b0a59aa8_5399817270232465212.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 14
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8372,
        "name": "醅幽蜜虫",
        "desc": "与醅幽花共生，会帮忙培育醅幽花并吸取花蜜的乖巧蜜虫。<br>可以<color=#FFE14BFF>通过点按召唤以发出指令</color>，将它们召唤到身边。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/26/1ef525b101a31611b9fe2cc1b0a59aa8_5399817270232465212.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 14
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8373,
        "name": "热舞乐台",
        "desc": "可以在热舞乐台的主控台上，操控整个热舞乐台！<br>搓动唱片盘、切换镜头，甚至可以控制乐台的机关和更改乐台的效果，快进行尝试吧！",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/26/1ef525b101a31611b9fe2cc1b0a59aa8_5399817270232465212.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 14
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8374,
        "name": "龙龙员工试运行",
        "desc": "<color=#FFE14BFF>拖动镜头</color>对准准备中的龙员工，在龙员工准备好时，即可敲响铃铛指示它们开始设备的操作。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/26/1ef525b101a31611b9fe2cc1b0a59aa8_5399817270232465212.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 14
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8375,
        "name": "龙龙员工试运行·游览船",
        "desc": "在龙员工准备好时，可以敲响铃铛，示意龙员工激活造浪机。而「大齿鲨鲨」则会随着时间间隔性上浮，看准时机，让造出的海浪适时推动游览船，尽可能<color=#FFE14BFF>令游览船穿过「大齿鲨鲨」的嘴巴</color>，可与试玩员的<color=#FFE14BFF>默契度上升</color>。<br>游览船达到终点时，与试玩员的默契度满足要求，即视为试运行成功！",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/08/26/1ef525b101a31611b9fe2cc1b0a59aa8_5399817270232465212.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 14
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 8376,
        "name": "阿夏快跑",
        "desc": "",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2025/11/03/326985891/1ef525b101a31611b9fe2cc1b0a59aa8_4692433710595200448.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 14
